  <name>Calendar</name>
  <summary>View and manage your events</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      A calendar for the COSMIC desktop. Events are stored as standard
      iCalendar files in a vdir layout, so they interoperate with vdirsyncer,
      khal, and any CalDAV server you point them at.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Month, week, and day views</li>
      <li>Multiple calendars with per-calendar colors and visibility</li>
      <li>Recurring events</li>
      <li>Picks up changes made by other tools on disk</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.entro314labs.Calendar.desktop</launchable>

